null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["yululu-q-9e6dfc8611d6ccf97dfa"]},"ordering_evidence":"yululu-q-9e6dfc8611d6ccf97dfa","order":10279},{"id":"santizhu064-e-sr-hong-conspiracy","title":"孙弘秘权死问、欲矫诏除诸葛恪","accounts":[{"id":"santizhu064-a-29b6f7ad13b4416878e0","label":"正文","text":"权薨翌日，弘素与恪不平惧为恪所治，秘不发丧，欲矫诏除恪（谋议，未行）","evidence":["santizhu064-q-c5baef5533e9e1b2e22a"]}],"participants":[{"person":"zhanggu-p0009","role":"秘权死问，欲矫诏除诸葛恪（谋议未行）","evidence":["santizhu064-q-c5baef5533e9e1b2e22a"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0041","role":"被谋除对象","evidence":["santizhu064-q-c5baef5533e9e1b2e22a"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"未由相邻段落推算纪年；原文时间表达保留在来源引句中。","evidence":["santizhu064-q-c5baef5533e9e1b2e22a"]},"ordering_evidence":"santizhu064-q-c5baef5533e9e1b2e22a","source_order":[64,130,0],"order":10946},{"id":"santizhu064-e-sr-hong-execution","title":"孙峻告恪、恪请弘咨事于坐中诛弘、发丧制服","accounts":[{"id":"santizhu064-a-53eb7d44060d4b0d4b2a","label":"正文","text":"峻以弘谋告恪；恪请弘咨事，于坐中诛弘；乃为权发丧制服","evidence":["santizhu064-q-37abe821c78b03d20d33"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0075","role":"以弘谋告诸葛恪","evidence":["santizhu064-q-37abe821c78b03d20d33"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0041","role":"请弘议事、于坐中诛弘，并主持发丧制服","evidence":["santizhu064-q-37abe821c78b03d20d33"]},{"person":"zhanggu-p0009","role":"被诛者","evidence":["santizhu064-q-37abe821c78b03d20d33"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"未由相邻段落推算纪年；原文时间表达保留在来源引句中。","evidence":["santizhu064-q-37abe821c78b03d20d33"]},"ordering_evidence":"santizhu064-q-37abe821c78b03d20d33","source_order":[64,130,0],"order":10947}],"persons":[{"id":"zhanggu-p0009","name":"孙弘","evidence":["zhanggu-q-23a17f954aec89d98b81","santizhu064-q-0cd125a5dffbd7fd1faa","santizhu064-q-a35719e340f4db529dab","feipin-q-8845d0d33dfafc146b69","yululu-q-0d0e0925d00ca93e3912","yululu-q-9e6dfc8611d6ccf97dfa","yululu-q-2e73720b6a1a8b6f76e1"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"yululu-m-f086ab5bbab2a2120c96","kind":"mention","text":"本篇原文记及孙弘，具体行动与称谓见引文。","evidence":["yululu-q-2e73720b6a1a8b6f76e1"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"feipin-q-8845d0d33dfafc146b69","section":"chapter-050","block":"b-90b2784ebf9809f302b9","layer":"original","quote":"权不豫〖4〗，夫人使问中书令孙弘吕后专制故事〖5〗。","section_title":"妃嫔传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0107.xhtml","index":98,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":23,"end":49},{"id":"santizhu-q-a8671dfa719ada9608d6","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-87c726d1b34c674ff45f","layer":"original","quote":"冬，权寝疾，征大将军诸葛恪为太子太傅，会稽太守滕胤为太常〖5〗：并受诏辅太子","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":4,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":38},{"id":"santizhu064-q-0af572f7d632a75c4086","section":"chapter-064","block":"b-a6908d269427a618f174","layer":"pei","quote":"后引恪等见卧内，受诏床下。权诏曰：‘吾疾困矣。恐不复相见，诸事一以相委！’恪歔欷流涕曰：‘臣等皆受厚恩，当以死奉诏！愿陛下安精神，损思虑，无以外事为念。’权诏有司：诸事一统于恪；惟杀生大事，然后以闻。为治第馆，设陪卫。群官百司，拜揖之仪，各有品叙。诸法令有不便者，条列以闻，权辄听之。中外翕然，人怀欢欣","attribution":"裴注·吴书","section_title":"诸葛滕二孙濮阳传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0135.xhtml","index":161,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-30fdc972641848aeb074","start":71,"end":222},{"id":"santizhu064-q-0cd125a5dffbd7fd1faa","section":"chapter-064","block":"b-8f3528755e98f64edf66","layer":"original","quote":"翌日，权薨。弘素与恪不平〖3〗，惧为恪所治；秘权死问〖4〗，欲矫诏除恪〖5〗。峻以告恪，恪请弘咨事；于坐中诛之，乃发丧制服〖6〗。","section_title":"诸葛滕二孙濮阳传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0135.xhtml","index":129,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":65},{"id":"santizhu064-q-0e7db2ae4b51bf6a222c","section":"chapter-064","block":"b-a6908d269427a618f174","layer":"pei","quote":"权寝疾，议所付托。时朝臣咸皆注意于恪，而孙峻表恪器任辅政，可付大事。权嫌恪刚狠自用；峻以当今朝臣皆莫及，遂固保之：乃征恪","attribution":"裴注·吴书","section_title":"诸葛滕二孙濮阳传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0135.xhtml","index":161,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-30fdc972641848aeb074","start":10,"end":70},{"id":"santizhu064-q-37abe821c78b03d20d33","section":"chapter-064","block":"b-8f3528755e98f64edf66","layer":"original","quote":"峻以告恪，恪请弘咨事；于坐中诛之，乃发丧制服〖6〗。","section_title":"诸葛滕二孙濮阳传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0135.xhtml","index":129,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":39,"end":65},{"id":"santizhu064-q-6e387014176f2cdc6a30","section":"chapter-064","block":"b-9d25e64235c0d861b5e6","layer":"original","quote":"太元元年，权寝疾〖7〗。诣都〖8〗，留为太常，与诸葛恪等俱受遗诏辅政。","section_title":"诸葛滕二孙濮阳传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0135.xhtml","index":360,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":35},{"id":"santizhu064-q-9738c31389ca10915f3b","section":"chapter-064","block":"b-bb7af4361400a25e7d33","layer":"original","quote":"久之，权不豫〖1〗。而太子少，乃征恪以大将军领太子太傅〖2〗，中书令孙弘领少傅。权疾困，召恪、弘及太常滕胤、将军吕据、侍中孙峻，属以后事","section_title":"诸葛滕二孙濮阳传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0135.xhtml","index":128,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":68},{"id":"santizhu064-q-a35719e340f4db529dab","section":"chapter-064","block":"b-8f3528755e98f64edf66","layer":"original","quote":"峻以告恪，恪请弘咨事；于坐中诛之，乃发丧制服〖6〗。","section_title":"诸葛滕二孙濮阳传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0135.xhtml","index":129,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":39,"end":65},{"id":"santizhu064-q-c5baef5533e9e1b2e22a","section":"chapter-064","block":"b-8f3528755e98f64edf66","layer":"original","quote":"翌日，权薨。弘素与恪不平〖3〗，惧为恪所治；秘权死问〖4〗，欲矫诏除恪〖5〗。","section_title":"诸葛滕二孙濮阳传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0135.xhtml","index":129,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":39},{"id":"santizhu064-q-d14aaec4798e4c86c446","section":"chapter-064","block":"b-bb7af4361400a25e7d33","layer":"original","quote":"久之，权不豫〖1〗。而太子少，乃征恪以大将军领太子太傅〖2〗，中书令孙弘领少傅。权疾困，召恪、弘及太常滕胤、将军吕据、侍中孙峻，属以后事。﹝一﹞","section_title":"诸葛滕二孙濮阳传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0135.xhtml","index":128,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":72},{"id":"yululu-q-0d0e0925d00ca93e3912","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-cd72c8ae1fc875f424fb","layer":"original","quote":"未到，中书令孙弘谮润据","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":472,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":57,"end":68},{"id":"yululu-q-2e73720b6a1a8b6f76e1","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-cd72c8ae1fc875f424fb","layer":"original","quote":"赤乌九年，迁骠骑将军。遭二宫构争〖11〗，据拥护太子；言则恳至，义形于色，守之以死。﹝一﹞遂左迁新都郡丞〖12〗。未到，中书令孙弘谮润据〖13〗。因权寝疾，弘为诏书，追赐死。时年五十七。","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":472,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":93},{"id":"yululu-q-9e6dfc8611d6ccf97dfa","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-cd72c8ae1fc875f424fb","layer":"original","quote":"因权寝疾，弘为诏书，追赐死。时年五十七","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":472,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":73,"end":92},{"id":"zhanggu-q-23a17f954aec89d98b81","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-0ccf265f45e5a3e57842","layer":"original","quote":"中书令孙弘佞伪险诐〖21〗，休素所忿。﹝四﹞弘因是谮诉〖22〗，下诏书赐休死，时年四十一","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":96,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":53,"end":97}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
